            "paragraph": "Critically, the ecological fragility of this area was underscored by the devastating September 15-16, 2025, flood event in Site-5, where 264 mm of rainfall within 24 hours triggered flash flooding at this prominent tourist hub. Intense hourly spells\u2014 54 mm between 5:15 and 6:15 am, following 49 mm the previous hour\u2014pushed the landscape to its hydrological limits (Luthra, n.d.), (Siasat.com, 2025). The coincidence of rapid deforestation, expanding impervious surfaces, and extreme rainfall highlights the compounded vulnerability of Dehradun's urban ecosystems, demonstrating how land use change and climate anomalies converge to",
