            "target_entity_type": "City",
            "paragraph": "Dehradun has experienced significant climate alterations in the past ten years, revealed in (Figure 10), marking it as a Himalayan hotspot. Data reveal a 1.2\u00b0C increase in mean annual temperature (from 23.6\u00b0C in 2015-2017 to 24.8\u00b0C in 2023-2025), exceeding worldwide trends (Wang et al., 2023).",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": false,
