            "relation": "IMPACTED_REGION",
            "target_entity_instance": "Dehra Dun",
            "target_entity_type": "City",
            "paragraph": "Notably, the pace of warming accelerated 2.6-fold post-2020 (0.21\u00b0C/yr vs. 0.08\u00b0C/yr pre-2020), culminating in unprecedented extremes such as June 2024's record-breaking 27.94\u00b0C monthly average\u2014 the first time monthly readings crossed the 27\u00b0C threshold.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
